       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-OPTO-ELAST.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-OPTO-ELAST-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SHEAR-LAUNCH-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SHEAR-VELOCITY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAYLEIGH-DIFFRACT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OAE-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OAE-SEAL-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-OPTO-ELAST-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-POE-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-POE-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LAUNCH-AND-VEL.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DIFFRACT-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-POE-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LAUNCH-AND-VEL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SHEAR-LAUNCH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SHEAR-VELOCITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DIFFRACT-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RAYLEIGH-DIFFRACT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OAE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-POE-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SHEAR-LAUNCH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SHEAR-VELOCITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RAYLEIGH-DIFFRACT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-OAE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-OAE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-POE-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-POE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-POE-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-POE-CODE.
